  "details": "On `VRCPhysBoneCollider` component where `ShapeType=Capsule`, the default value of `Height` is zero. So practically it is not a capsule but a sphere. I think this is misleading especially for newcomers.\nThe default value of `Radius` is `0.5`. If the `Height` is `2.0`, it will be the same shape of the Capsule in Unity build-in 3D model and will be easy to understand.\nTested with `VRCSDK3-AVATAR-2022.03.10.14.12_Public.unitypackage` (build 1183)",
